# {{ title }}

The study dataset of a BIDS study
([BIDS study dataset](https://bids-specification.readthedocs.io/en/stable/common-principles.html#study-dataset)):
a DataLad superdataset holding every dataset of the study as a subdataset, at the path the
ma-DMP (`dmp.json`) gives it.

    rawbids/                 raw BIDS dataset (the only BIDS-compliant subdirectory)
    derivatives/<pipeline>/  BIDS-Derivatives datasets, one per pipeline
    sourcedata/              not populated: sourcedata streams are per-instrument datasets,
                             each derived dataset links them under its own sourcedata/
    dmp.json                 machine-actionable data management plan

Get the study without its data, then the data you need:

    datalad clone <this repository> study
    datalad get -n -r study
    datalad get study/derivatives/fmriprep/sub-01

The `dev` branch follows accepted data; `rel/<version>` and `main` hold releases.
